{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-editorial\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #34444b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 auto; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 677px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 0; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; text-align: justify; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #34444b; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\"\u003e干净纯白纸面配清爽连续正文，不堆砌花哨外框，让读者打开就能顺畅进入阅读节奏。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg\" alt=\"自然光书桌与敞开的笔记本\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cw-layout-section-number\" style=\"background-color: #087f8c; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.7; margin-right: 9px; padding: 1px 8px; vertical-align: 3px\"\u003e01\u003c/span\u003e从清晰小节建立阅读节奏\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003cp style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\"\u003e左齐青绿 01 数字方标利落醒目，重点句只需克制强调一次，其余交给舒适行距与留白。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #edf7f7; border-left: 1px solid #087f8c; color: #075a63; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e排版的任务，是把内容的逻辑关系清爽地呈现出来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cw-layout-section-number\" style=\"background-color: #087f8c; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.7; margin-right: 9px; padding: 1px 8px; vertical-align: 3px\"\u003e02\u003c/span\u003e高频日更号的常备基准款\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003cul style=\"background-color: #f7f9f8; border-left: 1px solid #087f8c; margin: 0 0 15px; padding: 14px 16px 14px 36px; padding-left: 22px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e白底黑字配淡青左线引语，清爽耐看不挑题材\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e自动为每个章节生成青绿 01 / 02 数字方标\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e适配观点解读、职场攻略、产品公告与深度科普\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"background-color: #edf7f7; border-top: 3px solid #087f8c; color: #34444b; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 18px 20px; text-align: justify\"\u003e清爽克制的版式，永远经得起读者反复打开。\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection class=\"cw-layout-end-mark\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; padding: 27px 0 8px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #e06445; display: inline-block; height: 3px; vertical-align: middle; width: 34px\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #65767c; display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 10px; vertical-align: middle\"\u003eEND\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #087f8c; display: inline-block; height: 3px; vertical-align: middle; width: 34px\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
